+    <section class="trial-banner"><div><span class="section-kicker">你的第一步，可以很轻松</span><h2>还没想好？先开口聊一聊。</h2><p>体验 25 分钟一对一口语课，找到适合自己的学习方向。</p></div><button class="button dark" data-plan="trial">了解体验课 <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></section>
+
+    <section id="faq" class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div><span class="section-kicker" lang="en">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</span><h2 id="faq-title">你可能还想知道</h2><p>开始之前，把小问号变成安心。</p></div><div class="faq-list">
+      <details><summary>英语基础比较弱，可以报名吗？<span>+</span></summary><p>可以。课程开始前会进行水平评估。一对一课程根据你的起点制定计划，小班课则匹配水平相近的学员，让练习难度适合你。</p></details>
+      <details><summary>一对一和小班课，应该怎么选？<span>+</span></summary><p>如果你有明确的面试、工作或表达目标，且希望灵活安排时间，可以选择一对一。想培养长期习惯、喜欢和伙伴互动，则可以选择小班课。</p></details>
+      <details><summary>课包有效期是多久？<span>+</span></summary><p>12 节课包有效期为 3 个月，24 节课包有效期为 6 个月，从首次上课日起计算。建议保持每周至少一节的学习节奏。</p></details>
+      <details><summary>如何上课？需要准备什么？<span>+</span></summary><p>课程通过在线视频进行。准备网络稳定的电脑或平板、麦克风和耳机即可。上课前检查摄像头和音频，并找一个适合专注交流的空间。</p></details>
+    </div></section>
+  </main>
+
+  <footer><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#"><span class="brand-word" lang="en">speakup<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span><span class="brand-cn">开口英语</span></a><p>让世界，听见你的声音。</p><span>© 2026 Speakup · 课程价格展示</span></footer>
+
+  <dialog id="plan-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="关闭弹窗">×</button><span class="section-kicker">从一次对话开始</span><h2 id="dialog-title"></h2><p id="dialog-description"></p><div class="dialog-summary" id="dialog-summary"></div><p class="demo-note">这是课程方案演示页，暂未接入预约或支付服务，不会产生订单或费用。</p><button class="button dark dialog-done">了解了，继续看看</button></dialog>
+
+  <script>
+    let selectedPackage = 12;
+    const courses = {
+      personal: { name: '外教一对一', prices: {12: 168, 24: 151.2}, duration: '每节 50 分钟', description: '专属老师与定制计划，按照你的节奏练习表达。' },
+      group: { name: '活力小班课', prices: {12: 68, 24: 61.2}, duration: '每节 60 分钟 · 4 人小班', description: '和水平相近的伙伴一起，在真实对话中持续进步。' }
+    };
+    const money = value => value.toLocaleString('zh-CN', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-package]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+      selectedPackage = Number(button.dataset.package);
+      document.querySelectorAll('[data-package]').forEach(item => {
+        const active = Number(item.dataset.package) === selectedPackage;
+        item.classList.toggle('selected', active);
+        item.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
+      });
+      Object.entries(courses).forEach(([key, course]) => {
+        document.getElementById(key + '-price').textContent = money(course.prices[selectedPackage]);
+        document.getElementById(key + '-total').textContent = `${selectedPackage} 节课 · 共 ¥${money(course.prices[selectedPackage] * selectedPackage)} · 有效期 ${selectedPackage === 12 ? 3 : 6} 个月`;
+      });
+    }));
+    const dialog = document.getElementById('plan-dialog');
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+      const course = courses[button.dataset.plan];
+      document.getElementById('dialog-title').textContent = course ? course.name : '先体验一次，自在开口';
+      document.getElementById('dialog-description').textContent = course ? course.description : '25 分钟一对一交流，包含口语水平评估、场景练习与学习建议。';
+      document.getElementById('dialog-summary').textContent = course ? `${selectedPackage} 节课 · ${course.duration} · 总价 ¥${money(course.prices[selectedPackage] * selectedPackage)}` : '体验内容：了解目标 → 口语练习 → 专属建议';
+      dialog.showModal();
+    }));
+    document.querySelectorAll('.close-dialog, .dialog-done').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close()));
+    dialog.addEventListener('click', event => { if (event.target === dialog) { const r = dialog.getBoundingClientRect(); if (event.clientX < r.left || event.clientX > r.right || event.clientY < r.top || event.clientY > r.bottom) dialog.close(); } });
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
